# This file allows specifying additional repositories to use
# when building gluon.
#
# In most cases, it is not required so don't add it.

##	GLUON_SITE_FEEDS
#		for each feed name given, add the corresponding PACKAGES_* lines
#		documented below
GLUON_SITE_FEEDS='community'

PACKAGES_COMMUNITY_REPO=https://github.com/freifunk-gluon/community-packages.git
PACKAGES_COMMUNITY_COMMIT=8cfbced053cbf20a5d053aae6bf68ff81a229007
PACKAGES_COMMUNITY_BRANCH=main

##	OpenWrt base
#		The intel-mips target (AVM FRITZ!Box 7560, 7580 and 7590) needs
#		kernel 6.18, which only OpenWrt main carries. Gluon next pins
#		openwrt-25.12, so the target cannot be built from Gluon's own base.
#
#		The pin below is a branch of OpenWrt main that adds the intel-mips
#		target, with its two switch macros driven by a DSA driver. Every
#		target in ./targets builds on it, not only intel-mips.
#
#		scripts/modules.sh sources Gluon's modules file first and this one
#		second, so these assignments override Gluon's own pin. Gluon has
#		set OPENWRT_REPO and the others by then, which makes a
#		${OPENWRT_REPO:-...} default a silent no-op. The escape hatch
#		therefore uses names Gluon does not set itself.
OPENWRT_REPO=${SITE_OPENWRT_REPO:-https://github.com/grische/openwrt.git}
OPENWRT_BRANCH=${SITE_OPENWRT_BRANCH:-intel-mips-xrx500-dsa}
OPENWRT_COMMIT=${SITE_OPENWRT_COMMIT:-d36c53ca930cbca073aea30b54acf3fdf5fe9ef4}

##	Routing feed
#		Gluon next pins openwrt/routing at openwrt-25.12, whose batman-adv
#		2025.4 does not build on kernel 6.18, for two reasons:
#
#		  * It depends unconditionally on kmod-lib-crc32c, which OpenWrt
#		    main declares "@LINUX_6_12" because libcrc32c was folded into
#		    the kernel after 6.12. package-metadata.pl passes the
#		    unsatisfiable dependency on to every package that selects it,
#		    so kmod-batman-adv, and through it every Gluon batman package,
#		    cannot be enabled.
#		  * Its EXTRA_CFLAGS are dropped by the 6.18 kbuild, so it would
#		    compile its feature sources against structures built without
#		    those features.
#
#		The feed fixed both after moving to batman-adv 2026.x and then
#		moved the package to openwrt/packages. e76fbe6 is the last routing
#		commit that carries it, batman-adv 2026.2 with "fix build against
#		Linux 6.18" and the 6.18.33+ kmalloc_obj fix. Gluon's three routing
#		patches apply to it unchanged.
PACKAGES_ROUTING_REPO=${SITE_PACKAGES_ROUTING_REPO:-https://github.com/openwrt/routing.git}
PACKAGES_ROUTING_BRANCH=${SITE_PACKAGES_ROUTING_BRANCH:-master}
PACKAGES_ROUTING_COMMIT=${SITE_PACKAGES_ROUTING_COMMIT:-e76fbe6fb11b5dda37e3832582a4ee0f64176ad1}
